<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:lrc="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" lrc:timing="Word" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1000"/><sourceMetadata xmlns="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.120"><translations><translation automaticallyCreated="true" type="subtitle" xml:lang="en-US"><text for="L1">All jumbled up</text><text for="L2">My hand that lost its grip</text><text for="L3">Just clutches my pocket tightly</text><text for="L4">Our tangled gazes don't know what to do</text><text for="L5">Creak, creak, creak</text><text for="L6">Now I see, I'm in love, you've found me out completely</text><text for="L7">Since you can see my heart is dancing</text><text for="L8">The trembling that seems to almost touch but misses</text><text for="L9">Creak, creak, creak</text><text for="L10">Du, du-ru-ru-ru-ru-du-du</text><text for="L11">Du-ru-ru-ru-ru-du-du</text><text for="L12">Du-ru-du-du</text><text for="L13">The two of us, du-ru-ru-ru-ru-du-du</text><text for="L14">Du-ru-ru-ru-ru-du-du</text><text for="L15">Du-ru-du-du</text><text for="L16">I try to casually lean on your shoulder</text><text for="L17">What if my breath reaches you first</text><text for="L18">You say hoo, then I fly</text><text for="L19">The distance between us is a close-up</text><text for="L20">My stomach cluelessly makes a rumbling sound</text><text for="L21">Ah, it's so loud, so loud, so loud</text><text for="L22">Now I see, I'm in love, you've found me out completely</text><text for="L23">Since you can see my heart is dancing</text><text for="L24">The trembling that seems to almost touch but misses</text><text for="L25">Creak, creak, creak</text><text for="L26">Such a pretty young thing</text><text for="L27">In my queen's secret garden</text><text for="L28">And now I rock with you</text><text for="L29">You're producing my soul</text><text for="L30">I want to fix my stuttering pronunciation of the word love</text><text for="L31">A purple sky spreads on the palette</text><text for="L32">I look forward to tomorrow</text><text for="L33">I look forward to every day</text><text for="L34">One step at a time to you</text><text for="L35">I match your speed</text><text for="L36">So soft, so soft, so soft, love</text><text for="L37">Du, du-ru-ru-ru-ru-du-du</text><text for="L38">Du-ru-ru-ru-ru-du-du</text><text for="L39">Du-ru-du-du</text><text for="L40">The two of us, du-ru-ru-ru-ru-du-du</text><text for="L41">Du-ru-ru-ru-ru-du-du</text><text for="L42">Du-ru-du-du</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Crush</songwriter><songwriter>haventseenyou</songwriter></songwriters><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ko-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="11.077" end="11.744" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">dwi</span> <span begin="11.744" end="12.095" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">juk</span> <span begin="12.095" end="12.409" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">bak</span> <span begin="12.409" end="13.170" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">juk</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="13.170" end="13.937" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kkak</span> <span begin="13.937" end="14.518" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ji</span>  <span begin="14.518" end="14.831" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">no</span> <span begin="14.831" end="15.113" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">chin</span>  <span begin="15.113" end="15.999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">so</span> <span begin="15.999" end="16.440" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">neun</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="16.600" end="17.253" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ju</span> <span begin="17.253" end="17.594" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">meo</span> <span begin="17.594" end="17.910" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ni</span> <span begin="17.910" end="18.756" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">man</span>  <span begin